Helicopter drop oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-08. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the helicopter drop probes run the game screen's part of the drop frame by frame: the start of a run
(gfTacticalDoHeliRun) and the first-time block of MainGameScreenHandle move into HandleTacticalDoHeliRun and
HandleFirstTimeInGameScreen, called where the code was. Two switches in Merc_Entering.cc, off in the game:
gfOracleHeliEscape stands for _KeyDown(SDLK_ESCAPE) in HandleHeliDrop, and gfOracleHeliLiveSample gives the run a
stand-in sample id when PlayJA2Sample returns NO_SAMPLE (-nosound), so the fades ramp as with sound (SoundSetVolume and
SoundStop do nothing for it). Appended accessors read the file statics of Merc_Entering.cc (the seats, the script
state, the fades, the heli tile, gubMoveAwayRepeated and REPEAT_HELI_MOVEAWAY), Tile_Animation.cc tells whether a tile
is still in the anitile list, Overhead.cc exposes the static CheckForLosingEndOfBattle, and ScreenMsg hands every message
to gOracleScreenMessageHook when the oracle sets one. No behaviour change while the switches and the hook are off.
Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0030.

